### Criar usuário
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Gabriel",
    "email": "gabriel@teste.com",
    "senha": "123456"
}

### Fazer login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "gabriel@teste.com",
    "senha": "123456"
}

### Testar rota protegida sem token
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Testar rota protegida com token
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Criar cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/clients
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Empresa Exemplo LTDA",
    "documento": "12.345.678/0001-90",
    "endereco": "João Pessoa - PB",
    "representante": "João da Silva",
    "email": "contato@empresa.com",
    "telefone": "(83) 99999-9999",
    "observacoes": "Cliente de teste"
}

### Listar clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clients
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI
### Buscar cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/clients/ID_DO_CLIENTE
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Clientes sem autenticação
GET http://localhost:3000/clients

### Editar cliente
PATCH http://localhost:3000/clients/ID_DO_CLIENTE
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
    "nome": "Empresa Exemplo Atualizada",
    "telefone": "(83) 98888-8888"
}

### Desativar cliente
PATCH http://localhost:3000/clients/ID_DO_CLIENTE/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI